            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I am using `MiniPick.builtin.files()`.\n\nI am afraid, I still can not reproduce. Would mind to:\n- Make sure that you are reproducing with clean config. Please follow the steps described in the original post.\n- Add more details:\n    - How you start the picker. Is it `:Pick files` or something else?\n    - The exact file system structure. Maybe the `coração.md` file must be nested?\n    - The exact query with which you experience this. Maybe it happens with specific query?\n\nThe `\"\"` present in item names makes me think that there is something interfering with `:Pick files`.",
